Source: unios-desktop-settings
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Apostolos Chalis <achalis@csd.auth.gr>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/unios-team/unios-desktop-settings

Package: unios-desktop-settings
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: plasma-welcome
Replaces: plasma-welcome
Description: UniOS default desktop settings and branding
 Applies the default UniOS wallpaper and Breeze Dark theme to KDE
 Plasma, configures skel defaults for new user accounts, and
 removes the plasma-welcome first-run screen. Runs automatically
 on install via the package's postinst script.
